  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://sssc.uk.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Uttarakhand Subordinate Service Selection Commission (UKSSSC)</a> </span>has released the admit card for the post of Village Development Officer (VDO), Patwari, Lekhpal, Village Panchayat Development Officer (VPDO), Personal Assistant &amp; Other Various Post. This recruitment was released for 416 posts. Applications for the UKSSSC VDO, Patwari &amp; Other Post Recruitment 2025 were accepted from April 15, 2025, to May 15, 2025. The written examination is going to be conducted on 14 June 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their UKSSSC VDO, Patwari &amp; Other Post Admit Card 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttarakhand Subordinate Service Selection Commission (UKSSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UKSSSC VDO, Patwari &amp; Other Post Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UKSSSC Group C Advt. No. 70/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>15 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>15 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>15 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>15 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Form Correction Date : <strong>15 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>14 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>08 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC <strong>: Rs. 300/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, EWS <strong>: Rs. 150/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UKSSSC Group C Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Patwari </strong>Post :&nbsp;<strong>21-38 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Lekhpal </strong>Post :&nbsp;<strong>21-35 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>All Other</strong> Post : <strong>21-42 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UKSSSC Group C Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UKSSSC Group C 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 416 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> Village Development Officer (VDO)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">205</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> Patwari</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> 119</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> Lekhpal</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> 61</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> Village Panchayat Development Officer (VPDO)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> 01</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> Assistant Superintendent</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> 05</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Review Officer (ARO)&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> 03</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> Personal Assistant (PA)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> 03</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> Swagati</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> 03</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Sahayak Swagati</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UKSSSC Group C Bharti 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Village Development Officer (VDO)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates having Graduate Degree in any stream from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Patwari</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates having Graduate Degree in any stream from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Physical Efficiency :&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Running:</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Male candidates run 7 km in 60 minutes.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Female candidates run 3.5 km in 35 minutes.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Physical Standards :</strong> </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Hight :</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Male candidates 168 cm&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Female candidates 152 cm</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Chest : </strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Male candidates the chest should be 84 cms with expansion of which minimum expansion of 5 cms is mandatory.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Weight</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Female candidates minimum 45 Kg.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Lekhpal</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates having Graduate Degree in any stream from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Physical Efficiency :</strong>&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Running :&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Male candidates run 7 km in 60 minutes.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Female candidates run 3.5 km in 35 minutes.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Village Panchayat Development Officer (VPDO)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates having Graduate Degree in any stream from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must also possess minimum CCC level certificate in computer operation.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Superintendent</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates having Graduate Degree in any stream from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">01 year&nbsp;experience of administrative work in a Government organization or in a recognized voluntary organization.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Review Officer (ARO)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates having Graduate Degree in any stream from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Diploma in Computer Science or O Level certificate awarded by&nbsp;<strong>DOACC&nbsp;</strong>Society and minimum speed of&nbsp;<strong>4000 key</strong>&nbsp;depressions per hour in Hindi Computer Typing shall be mandatory.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Personal Assistant (PA)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates having Graduate Degree with Computer Science as a subject from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum speed of 80 words per minute in Hindi shorthand and minimum speed of 8000 key depressions per hour in Hindi typing on computer.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Only those candidates who fulfil the standard of minimum speed of 100 wpm in English shorthand and minimum speed of 9000 key depressions per hour in English typing on computer will be entitled to get bilingual allowance.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Swagati</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates having Graduate Degree in any stream from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Should have full ability to read, write and speak Hindi-English language and knowledge of Information Technology and Computer.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Sahayak Swagati</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates having Graduate Degree in any stream from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Should have full ability to read, write and speak Hindi-English language and knowledge of Information Technology and Computer.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download UKSSSC VDO, Patwari &amp; Other Post Admit Card 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Check the Important Links section</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Then click on the Download Admit Card link</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Candidate’s Application Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the admit card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The candidate can also download